Network platform and credential hygiene: endpoint only from page
configuration (no ?host=&port=, no URL override or default), receive-buffer
compaction with the end-position fix in RefreshRecvBuffer/RefreshSendBuffer,
no password characters kept in ObjectManager::m_szAccountPass, and PIN
keypad buffers cleared after each AccountSecure send.
Base: alanpetry/OpenWyd beb9f69bdea6d81f70af14b5ce85ed064575bb26

